：日志中仅有 `runtime process exiting` 的通用报错，缺失导致该状态的具体 Python 异常堆栈（如 `KeyError`、`AttributeError` 或 `Timeout`）。\n2. 缺失崩溃前的上下文：工具 `query_pod_logs` 执行失败（输入验证错误），导致未能获取上一容器崩溃瞬间（exit code 2 发生前）的详细业务日志或堆栈信息。\n3. 无法排除外部输入或依赖故障：由于缺乏详细日志，无法确认是否由特定输入数据或上游依赖瞬时故障引发。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 15.8s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 95.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-n5vp8: 95.1s (Evidence 86.1s, RCA 8.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 14.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-n5vp8**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 125.09, "metrics": {"run_id": "51ca342e58f9429e", "mttr": {"value": "2.1m", "seconds": 125.09722232818604, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "co